#: source/how-to/master_omniverse.rst:4
msgid "Mastering Omniverse for Robotics"
msgstr "掌握机器人的 Omniverse"

#: source/how-to/master_omniverse.rst:6
msgid ""
"These resources cover USD scene authoring and PhysX setup in Omniverse "
"tools. They are useful when preparing assets for Isaac Lab or working in "
"Isaac Sim. For Isaac Lab's physics configuration interface, see "
":doc:`/source/concepts/schema_cfgs`."
msgstr ""
"这些资源介绍 Omniverse 工具中的 USD 场景创建和 PhysX 配置，适用于准备 Isaac Lab 资产或在 Isaac Sim "
"中工作。Isaac Lab 的物理配置接口见 :doc:`/source/concepts/schema_cfgs`。"

